<title>USA: Stolt Comex to offer 3.5 mln common shrs.</title>
<headline>Stolt Comex to offer 3.5 mln common shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stolt Comex Seaway SA said Tuesday it will file a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission in early February to offer 3.5 million common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it will issue and sell the shares and use net proceeds to cut indebtness to its 70 percent shareholder, Stolt-Nielson SA.</p>
